{
 "batchId": "b-0474",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_eadd979ed7a65dc9c9f9",
   "sourceHash": "eadd979ed7a65dc9c9f98ca3e1ab17e1b5248a514087b434915f43a649eb83d6",
   "text": "瑜伽静修的效果在很大程度上取决于指导的水准。在Kairali，您将得到知识渊博的导师和阿育吠陀专业人员的照护，他们确保每一项治疗和练习都安全而有效。他们会帮助您理解瑜伽的基本原则，并学会将其运用于日常生活，从而长期受益。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_370caea4916057661c10",
   "sourceHash": "370caea4916057661c10d367225f18543918f371d2ebd2a8a5807b0a65df51cd",
   "text": "丰富多样的健康活动",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_368d3edc5d5ec8da5342",
   "sourceHash": "368d3edc5d5ec8da53423bac816d909536143b0d87b6eb5be415e0e7b32ade3a",
   "text": "为了丰富您的静修体验，除瑜伽和冥想外，Kairali还提供多种健康活动。自然漫步、阿育吠陀烹饪课以及正念与压力管理讲座等附加内容，都能让您的住院期间更加充实。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'stay' rendered as 住院期间 (stay at the hospital) to keep the clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_45cec9a834fa9ffd1e45",
   "sourceHash": "45cec9a834fa9ffd1e45d39075ef80ba31baeaf312b14be07e7b04d66350ba86",
   "text": "无微不至的接待与照顾",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_079c533f6277f7a673ac",
   "sourceHash": "079c533f6277f7a673ac57fea60d4a5d805f3559993d04be2a8c9ac04ed8e788",
   "text": "Kairali以细致周到和热情友好的接待而闻名。从舒适的住宿到营养丰富的阿育吠陀膳食，您此次来访的每一个环节都经过精心安排，力求为您提供最大程度的舒适与关照。团队致力于让您拥有一段美好的静修体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f2659e7fc6ac31cd6fc1",
   "sourceHash": "f2659e7fc6ac31cd6fc1724357e9d14bc3fcc7b85e26ba685b75df45f67cb448",
   "text": "长期益处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_703fd4fb75f999480c26",
   "sourceHash": "703fd4fb75f999480c26e0e6da2347f36ce8724a67350731611eb5d2032f00dd",
   "text": "在Kairali参加瑜伽静修，不仅仅是一次短暂的休整，更是对您长期健康的一项投资。住院期间学到的练习方法和知识，将为您提供所需的工具，使您在静修结束后依然能够保持平衡、健康的生活。这是迈向长期自我照护和整体健康的一步。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'vacation' rendered as 短暂的休整 (short break) per KTAHV language lock; 'stay' rendered as 住院期间."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f9bd62286d4ed2554049",
   "sourceHash": "f9bd62286d4ed2554049383c03ef2bbcea85d10efca5101420d764413e9ffb64",
   "text": "阿育吠陀治疗项目：我们为何需要它？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_edd8f35eef9fe75468df",
   "sourceHash": "edd8f35eef9fe75468dfc1bcf1027fab8d7353f3e86550929a25a647dc83d4b6",
   "text": "为何选择阿育吠陀治疗项目或静修？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9a5c642d390180b972f1",
   "sourceHash": "9a5c642d390180b972f178be51fce7235f956b9511e2a66cea88ba19b86fd934",
   "text": "木质治疗室内，Shirodhara（希罗达拉）药油缓缓流淌至患者额头，旁边是足部按摩与盛放草药制剂的黄铜碗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
